{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Reflection / Reflexion 反思机制\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">详细解释 Reflection 和 Reflexion 的区别与联系，它们如何让 Agent 实现自我反思和自我改进？在实际工程中如何落地？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心概念</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Reflection（反思）是一种让 Agent 在生成初步答案后，回顾自己的推理过程，识别错误、不足或可改进之处，然后进行修正的机制。Reflexion 是 Reflection 的增强版本，引入了显式的自我评估、外部反馈整合和长期记忆存储。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Reflection 的基本流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>生成</strong>：Agent 产生初始输出</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>评估</strong>：对输出进行自我评估（检查正确性、完整性、合理性）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>反思</strong>：分析问题和改进方向</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>修正</strong>：基于反思结果改进输出</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>迭代</strong>：重复直到满意或达到最大迭代次数</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Reflexion 的三角色架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">+--------+      +----------+      +------------------+\n| Actor  | ---&gt; | Evaluator| ---&gt; | Self-Reflection  |\n+--------+      +----------+      +------------------+\n    ^                                              |\n    +----------------------------------------------+\n                    (长期记忆反馈)\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Actor</strong>：执行任务（写代码、解决问题、采取行动）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Evaluator</strong>：评估 Actor 的输出质量，提供反馈（可以是规则评分、测试用例、LLM 评估）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Self-Reflection</strong>：基于 Evaluator 的反馈生成文本化的反思，存储到记忆中指导未来迭代</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Reflexion 的核心循环</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ReflexionAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> evaluator<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_trials<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluator <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> evaluator\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_trials <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> max_trials\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 长期记忆：存储反思</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        reflections <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> trial <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_trials<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Actor 执行任务（参考过去的反思）</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_build_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reflections<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. Evaluator 评估</span>\n            score<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> feedback <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>output<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>success_threshold<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> output  <span class=\"token comment\"># 成功</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. Self-Reflection 生成反思</span>\n            reflection <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_reflect<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> output<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> feedback<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> trial<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            reflections<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 达到最大尝试次数，返回最佳结果</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> output\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_reflect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> output<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> feedback<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> trial_num<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成反思文本\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"你刚刚尝试完成任务但失败了。请反思失败原因并总结经验：\n\n任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n你的输出: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>output<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n评估反馈: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>feedback<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n尝试次数: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>trial_num <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n请用一句话总结：\n1. 失败的主要原因是什么？\n2. 下次应该如何改进？\n\n反思:\"\"\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_build_context</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reflections<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"构建包含历史反思的上下文\"\"\"</span>\n        reflection_text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"反思 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>i<span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">enumerate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reflections<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n过去的经验教训:\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>reflection_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n注意避免之前犯过的错误。现在请重新尝试完成这个任务：\"\"\"</span></span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Reflection 与 Reflexion 的区别</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Reflection</th>\n<th>Reflexion</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈来源</td>\n<td>主要是自我评估</td>\n<td>自我评估 + 外部评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆存储</td>\n<td>通常短期</td>\n<td>显式的长期记忆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构角色</td>\n<td>单一 Agent 自我检查</td>\n<td>Actor + Evaluator + Self-Reflection 三角色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代深度</td>\n<td>浅层修正</td>\n<td>深层策略改进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>显著提升（HumanEval: 80% → 91%）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>实际落地要点</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Evaluator 设计</strong>：根据任务类型选择合适的评估方式</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">代码任务：单元测试 + 编译检查</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">推理任务：答案正确性检查</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">写作任务：LLM 评估 + 规则检查</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>反思存储</strong>：将反思文本存入向量数据库，形成 Agent 的\"经验教训\"</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>触发时机</strong>：任务失败后自动触发、定期回顾、关键节点主动检查</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>避免过度反思</strong>：设置最大尝试次数，防止陷入无限修正循环</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：Reflection 和 ReAct 是什么关系？答：Reflection 常以 ReAct 为基础，ReAct 解决\"如何行动\"，Reflection 解决\"如何改进行动\"。两者可以组合使用。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：Evalutor 的反馈可以是哪些类型？答：标量奖励（0-1分数）、文本反馈（详细评语）、二元信号（成功/失败）、人工反馈。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：如何防止 Reflexion 过度修正？答：设置最大尝试次数、设定修正幅度限制、记录修正历史避免循环修正。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：Reflection 只是让 LLM 重新生成一次。实际上 Reflection 的关键在于结构化的自我评估和经验积累。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：忽视 Evaluator 的质量。如果 Evaluator 本身不准确，反思方向就会偏。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：反思越多越好。实际上过度反思会增加延迟，需要在质量和效率间平衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>","headings":[]}